## How to run locally

With Node.js installed, run from the repository root:

```bash
uv sync --locked --extra dataset
uv pip install -r docs-requirements.txt
uv run --no-sync doc-builder preview lerobot "docs/source/{{ lang_tag }}" \
  --language {{ doc_builder_language }}
```

Open the URL printed by `doc-builder preview` to view the translated pages.

