You may include this sample checklist in your review comment. Adjust the items as needed and check
only what you verified:

```md
- [ ] Files reviewed: [list the file paths]
- [ ] Terminology and wording have no issues.
- [ ] The translation reads smoothly and is easy to understand.
- [ ] Documentation components render correctly in the preview.
- [ ] No paragraphs are missing compared with the English source.
- [ ] Links in the reviewed pages work.
```

